  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_016 (multimodal, concat fusion) achieved 0.526 validation accuracy. This experiment tests the impact of switching from 'concat' to 'weighted' fusion while keeping other settings identical (multimodal, singleprofile, pca_n2000 RNA, resnet50 image, no aggregation). This isolates the effect of fusion method, a critical design choice, and directly compares two common multimodal strategies. It balances exploitation (building on the prior multimodal approach) and exploration (testing a key variant)."
